tutorial.stage_1_text:
%{title}

Objective:
Move left and right across the board.
Notice stereo audio panning from Column 1 to Column 10.

Left wall (Column 1): %{left_status}
Right wall (Column 10): %{right_status}

Controls: Left/Right Arrows or A/D. Press Escape to exit tutorial.

tutorial.stage_3_text:
%{title}

Objective:
Inspect piece shape and rotate both clockwise and anticlockwise.

Piece Inspection (V / Semicolon): %{insp}
Clockwise Rotation (X / Period): %{cw}
Anticlockwise Rotation (Z / Comma): %{ccw}

Controls: V/Semicolon (Inspect), X/Period (CW), Z/Comma (CCW), Spacebar (Drop).

